<aside class="policy-note">
  <h2>Good to know, across every ANU residence</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>
      <strong>Not suitable for children or partners/family.</strong> ANU's family accommodation
      page states residences "are not suitable for children and no facilities for children are
      provided," and recommends off-campus housing for students bringing family. (
      <a href="https://study.anu.edu.au/accommodation/family-accommodation" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"
        >study.anu.edu.au/accommodation/family-accommodation</a
      >)
    </li>
    <li>
      <strong>No pets.</strong> ANU's residence Occupancy Agreement and moving-in checklist both
      state pets and other animals are not permitted in any ANU residence.
    </li>
  </ul>
  <p class="policy-note-gap">
    ANU doesn't publish an LGBTQ+-specific designation or a quiet/wellness floor policy for any
    residence — we can't show what ANU hasn't stated.
  </p>
</aside>
